# Public course files only. Everything else is local learner work by default.
# Keep answers, code, projects, notes, evidence, credentials, and generated files private.
# To publish a NEW course file, add its exact root-relative path below.
# Changes to existing public files remain visible to Git.
# This does not filter personal edits made inside an allowed course file.
# Ignore rules do not remove files from existing commits or override git add -f.

# Ignore all files, but traverse directories to reach the explicit public files.
*
!*/

